<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.333" end="00:00:02.767">Here are some words that begin<br />with the letter &quot;l.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.767" end="00:00:03.733">(makes &quot;l&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.733" end="00:00:05.267">Light.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:05.267" end="00:00:06.467">Lily.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.467" end="00:00:07.800">Lily pad.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:07.800" end="00:00:09.467">Lime.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.467" end="00:00:10.533">Lionel.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.533" end="00:00:11.867">Lollipop.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:11.867" end="00:00:14.000">Lemon.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.000" end="00:00:15.133">Lamp.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:15.133" end="00:00:16.533">Lick.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:16.533" end="00:00:17.933">Leona.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:17.933" end="00:00:18.733">&quot;L.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:18.733" end="00:00:19.733">(makes &quot;l&quot; sound)</p>
